	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"ジュリエッタが搭乗するギャラルホルンの高機動型試験機をキット化！",
			"両腕のジュリアンソードは、ソードモード、ウィップモードを選択式で装備。",
			"軟質素材を採用し、ウィップモードの表情付けが可能。",
			"脚部にはブレードパーツを装備。機体各所のバーニアが高機動戦闘を演出。",
			"足首は組み替えにより設置状態も再現。",
			"専用台座が付属し、無重力空間での戦闘を演出。"
		],
		"en": [
			"The Gjallarhorn high-mobility test machine that Julieta rides is now a kit!",
			"The Julian sword on both arms is equipped with a selection of sword mode and whip mode.",
			"Made of soft material, it is possible to create whip mode expressions.",
			"The legs are equipped with blade parts. Verniers throughout the aircraft produce high-mobility combat.",
			"The ankles can be rearranged to recreate the installation condition.",
			"A special pedestal is included to create a battle in zero gravity space."
		]
	},
